      "source": "```swift\nfunc tensor(forFunction function: String? = nil, argument: String, fillKnownDynamicShapes: Bool) -> BNNSTensor?\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\nfunc tensor(forFunction function: String? = nil, argument: String, fillKnownDynamicShapes: Bool) -> BNNSTensor?\n```",
